+Expected: PASS (3 tests). If the channel-name test fails, a seam module diverged — fix the seam, never the test.
+
+- [ ] **Step 3: Run the package gate**
+
+Run: `( cd bun-apps/pi-agent-ext-webui && bun run test )`
+Expected: PASS.
